cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the doc2lora method, please cite it as below."
title: "doc2lora-embedding: reproduction workflow for Decodable Representations of Scientific Ideas"
abstract: >-
  Turn documents into compact LoRA-shaped adapters, do arithmetic on them
  (average, interpolate, blend), and decode them back into text.
type: software
